  "notes": "Two separate but related failure events on the same day, both traced to failed SCRs associated with rod lift coils in the SCDE cabinet; each independently led to a manual RPS actuation via manually opened RTBs. No SSCs were inoperable at event onset and no SSFF occurred. Root cause of the SCR failures remained under investigation (CPED forensics) at time of report, consistent with cause code X (Other). No backup systems modeled since RPS/reactor trip is the terminal safety response, not a system requiring backup. No previous similar events found in 10-year review, so no SIMILAR_TO/stub LER emitted per narrative statement."
